{"pageid":2804,"title":"Easter Island","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Easter Island</span>","revid":22043,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Easter Island</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c9/Tutorial_Island.png/revision/latest?cb=20240317111941\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Tutorial Island\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c9/Tutorial_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240317111941\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c9/Tutorial_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240317111941 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c9/Tutorial_Island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240317111941 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Tutorial Island\" width=\"270\" height=\"135\" data-image-key=\"Tutorial_Island.png\" data-image-name=\"Tutorial Island.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtaining Gigantic Moai</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Also known as <i>Tutorial Island</i>, Pi Island contains ruins and huge chunks of <a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a> that are the biggest rocks that can be found in-game. The rocks unlike normal ones found on the mainland don't have any ores. The location is found roughly to the south-east of the beaches of the deserts of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. With the desert revamp changing its locations, it is highly recommended to use vehicles rather than swimming all the way there, and using the Refined Scuba Tank to drive underwater.\nOn the center of the island spawns one <a href=\"/wiki/GIGANTIC_MOAI\" title=\"GIGANTIC MOAI\">GIGANTIC MOAI</a>, which will only respawn after an 1-2 hour, though it is recommended to use a private/solo server as the moai has no owner when it first spawns, meaning others can take and/or claim it.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 165px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/revision/latest?cb=20240810135824\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A big chunk of  in Easter Island\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"165\" height=\"123\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Captura de tela 2024-07-25 212716.png\" data-image-key=\"Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/165?cb=20240810135824\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/revision/latest?cb=20240810135824\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A big chunk of  in Easter Island\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/165?cb=20240810135824\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"165\" height=\"123\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Captura de tela 2024-07-25 212716.png\" data-image-key=\"Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/50/Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/165?cb=20240810135824\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Captura_de_tela_2024-07-25_212716.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A big chunk of <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Rock\" title=\"Electrified Rock\">electric stone</a> in Easter Island</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>\nIt's possible to use the <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Michael's Copper Axe</a> to transform the chunks of Lightslate into <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Rock\" title=\"Electrified Rock\">Electrified Rock</a>.<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://discord.com/channels/865737627712749579/894303481421262923/1215061614076760126\">[1]</a></p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"7b844647134ab1d410b169ea1e81f656\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nameless_island-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px; top:40.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nameless_island.png\" title=\"Nameless island.png (2.25 MB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/11/Nameless_island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240505084308\" title=\"Nameless island.png (2.25 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Front view of the island.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nameless island.png\" data-image-key=\"Nameless_island.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Front view of the island.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Nameless island.png (2.25 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Front view of the island.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nameless island.png\" data-image-key=\"Nameless_island.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Front view of the island.\